aname": "169", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198847014909/", "num_games_owned": 23, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1009, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 858, "last_played": 1720729083, "avatar": "a782dd5f6d18db00148d8fde33579c8eecb014fe"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不好玩人都配不到玩尼玛", "timestamp_created": 1706589939, "timestamp_updated": 1706589939, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157161314", "author": {"steamid": "76561198830908417", "personaname": "吟遊詩人鄧超", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198830908417/", "num_games_owned": 237, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 6445, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6045, "last_played": 1725378873, "avatar": "93bb5c3f7aa6a33bcc3acfa7bea8b7476953d257"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "比较失败的一作，\n\n虽然在画面，模组，枪械零件，玩法，武器种类上有不少亮点，\n\n但是！在可玩性上远远不如求生之路2！\n\n因为官方忽略了重点，就是地图的制作，我玩了100小时也找不到一张亮点地图\n\n老版地图，死亡中心，黑色嘉年华，沼泽激战，暴风骤雨，教区，哪张地图不鲜明让人记忆深刻？\n\n你喋血复仇什么第一章第二章，每章地图都是糊糊的没有任何特色，\n\n最重要的还地图重复，有几张地图（加油站），可以说是多个章节反复使用，重复率太高。\n\n你制作不用心你就开放工坊，让广大玩家来帮你作图，你再把好的地图收进游戏(如求生2里的溪流险滩)\n\n你既不用心作图，也不开放工坊，格局太小！\n\n这类游戏玩的就是刺激冒险新鲜感，环境占了很大因素\n\n你反反复复就那么几张图，其他功能做的再好，图少，玩家也很容易玩吐了，\n\n只有增加各种特色鲜明的图，才能增加你的寿命！", "timestamp_created": 1706584250, "timestamp_updated": 1706584250, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 161, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.906238675117492676", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1571